{"id":"parecido","lemma":"parecido","pos":"adj","rank":1361,"glosses":["similar"],"ipa":"/paɾeˈθido/","forms":{"feminine":"parecida","masculinePlural":"parecidos","femininePlural":"parecidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-parecido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su coche es parecido al mío.","en":"His car is similar to mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/633190","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"car, automobile"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"mine"}]},{"text":"Nunca había visto nada parecido.","en":"I'd never seen anything like that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735120","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"seen"},{"g":"nothing"},null]},{"text":"Los dos hermanos son muy parecidos.","en":"The two brothers are very much alike.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538034","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"brother","l":"hermano"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null]},{"text":"Tu idea es parecida a la mía.","en":"Your idea is similar to mine.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"idea"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"a regiment of 100…"}]},{"text":"Tu problema y el mío son parecidos.","en":"Your problem and mine are similar.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"problem"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"mine"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}